 :doc "Derive exact physical identity from actual owner continuation, recheck orphan ownership, then invoke ordinary journal retirement without retagging.")
(defcost fn2-checkpoint-owned-retirement-poll-op :answers t :effects :per-use
 :tables (fn2-core-machines fn2-core-retirement-control fn2-core-checkpoint-future fn2-core-checkpoint-future-windows
          fn2-core-extents fn2-core-commit-settled fn2-core-pool fn2-core-control)
 :doc "Consume only the exact actor/extent/generation/member ordinary outcome; ambiguity retains staging and intent.")
